OL,3,CMurder investigation after 90-year-old
OL,4,Cwoman dies in house fire
OL,6,FA murder investigation has been
OL,7,Flaunched after a 90-year-old woman
OL,8,Fdied in a house fire.
OL,10,FEmergency services were called to
OL,11,FElmgrove Road West in Hardwicke,
OL,12,FGloucestershire, shortly before 4am on
OL,13,FSunday 16 August, after reports of a
OL,14,Ffire.
OL,16,FA woman in her 90s was found
OL,17,Funconscious inside the property and
OL,18,Flater pronounced dead.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/4
