OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F403A1786967344
OL,3,CMurder investigation after 90-year-old
OL,4,Cwoman dies in house fire
OL,6,FA woman in her 60s, from Gloucester,
OL,7,Fhas been arrested on suspicion of
OL,8,Fmurder and arson with intent to
OL,9,Fendanger life and remains in police
OL,10,Fcustody for questioning.
OL,12,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,13,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,14,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,15,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,17,FA spokeswoman for Gloucestershire
OL,18,FPolice said: "Officers attended the
OL,19,Fscene along with crews from the fire
OL,20,Fand ambulance services.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/4
