CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F403A1786967344
OL,3,CMurder investigation after 90-year-old
OL,4,Cwoman dies in house fire
OL,6,F"The property was searched and a woman
OL,7,Fin her 90s was found unconscious
OL,8,Finside.
OL,10,F"Emergency services performed CPR but
OL,11,Fdespite their best efforts, the woman
OL,12,Fwas sadly pronounced dead. Her next of
OL,13,Fkin has been informed.
OL,15,F"Police would like to reassure the
OL,16,Fpublic that those involved in the
OL,17,Fincident are known to each other and
OL,18,Fthis appears to have been an isolated
OL,19,Fincident.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/4
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
